{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30947","headline":"和于兴宗登越王楼诗 · 王铎","name":"和于兴宗登越王楼诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢眺题诗处，危楼压郡城。\n雨余江水碧，云断雪山明。\n锦绣来仙境，风光入帝京。\n恨无青玉案，何以报高情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}